Subject: [PATCH] Fix Career Training Platform: dead Interview Proof Map +
 insecure client-side AI calls

- Define iqSelect/iqLens/iqGenerate/iqCopy/iqClear, which were wired
  via onclick but never defined anywhere -- every button in the
  Interview Proof Map panel threw ReferenceError on click.
- Add server-side /api/career/ai-complete proxy (Anthropic-message-
  shaped response over Groq, matching the pattern every other TSM
  vertical uses) and SP.career system prompt.
- Point msaiTutor/msaiGenScen/msaiGradeAnswer/iqGenerate at the new
  proxy instead of calling https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages
  directly from the browser with no auth header -- that call could
  never have succeeded in production (no key, no CORS allowance).
- Remove a stale duplicate /api/mortgage/query stub that was
  shadowing the real handler (req.body.question/query shape vs. the
  kpis/loan_breaches/conditions/exceptions shape mortgage-engine.js
  actually sends).
